       REM  AN APPROXIMATE SOLUTION  TO THE MULTI-DIMENSIONAL           UMAP0001
       REM  TRANSPORTATION PROBLEM.  THIS PROGRAM HANDLES UP TO         UMAP0002
       REM  20 DIMENSIONS.                                              UMAP0003
       REM                                                              UMAP0004
       REM  THE FOLLOWING MACRO CAUSES THE SEQUENCE IN THE CALL         UMAP0005
       REM  TO BE REPEATED 19 TIMES.  IT MAY BE ELIMINATED BY MANUALLY  UMAP0006
       REM  INSERTING THE 19 COPIES OF THE SEQUENCE INTO CODE INSTEAD   UMAP0007
       REM  OF USING THE CALL FOR THIS MACRO.                           UMAP0008
       REM                                                              UMAP0009
       PMC                                                              UMAP0010
REP    MACRO   A,B                                                      U4AP0011
       REP1    19,(A),B                                                 UMAP0012
       END                                                              UMAP0013
       REM                                                              UMAP0014
REP1   MACRO   A,B,C                                                    UMAP0015
C      SET     A-1                                                      UMAP0016
       IRP     B                                                        UMAP0017
       B                                                                UMAP0018
       IRP                                                              UMAP0019
       WHEN    C,.E.,0                                                  UMAP0020
       SKIP                                                             UMAP0021
       REP1    C,(B),C                                                  UMAP0022
       END                                                              UMAP0023
       REM     THE FOLLOWING MACRO IS THE SAME AS REP, EXCEPT THAT IT   UMAP0024
       REM     HANDLES ONE PARTICULAR VERY LONG CALL.                   UMAP0025
       REM                                                              UMAP0026
DUP    MACRO   A                                                        UMAP0027
       DUP1    19,A                                                     UMAP0028
